      "writtenOn": "2017-11-29T22:12:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "At this stage, are most / all of your users running with SW sync / sysjump enabled? Also I think this check is redundant if you\u0027re ensuring system_get_image_copy() \u003d\u003d SYSTEM_IMAGE_RW.",
      "range": {
